BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.ResidualFrameCertificate.correction","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F}\n  (self : BfgsVerification.ResidualFrameCertificate R) (k : ℕ),\n  BfgsVerification.sqNorm ((self.V (k + 1)).transpose.mulVec ((R.shift self.J).gradientChange k)) ≤\n    self.C₀ * (R.shift self.J).curvature k","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
