BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.hessian_update","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (k : ℕ),\n  R.hessian (k + 1) =\n    R.hessian k - (R.q k)⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer (R.g k) (R.g k) +\n      (R.curvature k)⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer (R.gradientChange k) (R.gradientChange k)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
