BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.PotentialBandCertificate.absorb._proof_15","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {fstar c₁ c₂ η : ℝ}\n  (C : BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.PotentialBandCertificate F K fstar c₁ c₂ η),\n  ∀ x ∈ BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.positiveBand F K fstar η,\n    ∀ (g : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n      HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g) x →\n        Real.exp C.ψlo * C.m ≤ BfgsVerification.metricEnergy (Real.exp (C.Ψ x) • C.W x) g","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
