BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.ExactFrameCertificate.product_bound","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F}\n  (self : BfgsVerification.ExactFrameCertificate R) (k : ℕ),\n  self.J ≤ k →\n    ∀ (v : Fin self.r → ℝ),\n      BfgsVerification.sqNorm ((Matrix.transpose (self.P k)).mulVec v) ≤ self.K * BfgsVerification.sqNorm v","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
