BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.EnergyBudget.gap_sq_mul_reciprocal_sum_le","signature":"∀ {E q a R gap : ℕ → ℝ},\n  (∀ (k : ℕ), 0 ≤ E k) →\n    (∀ (k : ℕ), 0 < q k) →\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), 0 ≤ gap k) →\n        Antitone gap →\n          (∀ (k : ℕ), gap k ≤ a k) →\n            (∀ (k : ℕ), E (k + 1) = E k - a k ^ 2 / q k + R k) →\n              ∀ (N : ℕ), gap N ^ 2 * ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, (q k)⁻¹ ≤ E 0 + ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, R k","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
