BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.QuantitativeGrowth.hierarchy_fixed_tail_lower_eventually","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {E : ℕ → ℕ → ℝ} {q δ : ℕ → ℝ} {K C : ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.ScalarHierarchy.NormalizedHierarchy n E q δ K C →\n    (∀ (k : ℕ), 0 ≤ δ k) →\n      ∀ (J : ℕ) (D : ℝ),\n        0 < D →\n          (∀ (m : ℕ), ∑ i ∈ Finset.range m, δ (J + i) ≤ D) →\n            ∀ a < (2 * D)⁻¹, ∀ᶠ (N : ℕ) in Filter.atTop, a ≤ (∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, (q i)⁻¹) / ↑N ^ 2","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
