BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.normalizedHierarchy_of_principalMinorHierarchy","signature":"BfgsVerification.PrincipalMinorHierarchyTarget →\n  ∀ {n : ℕ} (R : BfgsVerification.FullBFGSRun n) (G c : ℝ),\n    0 < G →\n      0 < c →\n        (∀ (k : ℕ), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (R.g k) ≤ G ^ 2) →\n          (∀ (k : ℕ), c ≤ R.beta k) →\n            BfgsVerification.ScalarHierarchy.NormalizedHierarchy n (fun k => BfgsVerification.principalSum (R.H k)) R.q\n              (fun k => R.d k / c) (4 * G ^ 2 / c ^ 2) (G ^ 2)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
