BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.PotentialBandCertificate.absorb_field","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {fstar c₁ c₂ η : ℝ}\n  (C : BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.PotentialBandCertificate F K fstar c₁ c₂ η) (hc₂ : c₂ < 1)\n  (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), (C.absorb hc₂).W x = Real.exp (C.Ψ x) • C.W x","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
